 * macros/constants before including this file:
 *
 *  Types:
 *	unw_word	Unsigned integer type with at least 64 bits 
 *
 *  Register names:
 *	UNW_REG_BSP
 *	UNW_REG_BSPSTORE
 *	UNW_REG_FPSR
 *	UNW_REG_LC
 *	UNW_REG_PFS
 *	UNW_REG_PR
 *	UNW_REG_RNAT
 *	UNW_REG_PSP
 *	UNW_REG_RP
 *	UNW_REG_UNAT
